# Ad-hoc operator scripts. These have held server credentials in plaintext;
# the pattern is ignored so a `git add -A` can never publish one. Credentials
# belong in an SSH key or the server's own .env, never in a file here.
_*.py
_*.sh
*_tmp.py
*_tmp.sh
